/* Security and browser hardening for static hosting */
/* Applies when deployed on Netlify. */
/* Header values are intentionally conservative for a static portfolio. */
/* The CSP is intentionally omitted here because the app loads external fonts and project assets. */

/* Global response headers */
/*
  These headers reduce accidental MIME sniffing, referrer leakage, and unnecessary browser permissions.
*/
/
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
